      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231781/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine dashi, soy sauce, mirin, and sugar in a bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Gjq4rO0Csow9AMaDiM8i74s9OY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231781-Beef-Sukiyaki-ddmfs-step-1-071-424f1650fc7f4dca8f08318d335959c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231781/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soak noodles in boiling water for 1 minute. Drain, rinse under cold water, and drain again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g8-7QY0a1eXVKBG9QyrtpfubCRE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231781-Beef-Sukiyaki-ddmfs-step-2-072-c258654191be4b4badeeffcd22d95adf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231781/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 2 tablespoons oil in a pot over medium heat. Add beef; cook and stir until no longer pink, 2 to 3 minutes. Transfer beef to a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6nYEcmolzJTpo5scW0PW2xjQfdA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231781-Beef-Sukiyaki-ddmfs-step-4-078-e42365f4539c47eb94d836a382d90f43.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231781/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining 1 tablespoon oil to the pot and heat over medium heat. Add onion, carrots, celery, and mushrooms; cook and stir until softened, about 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7Qc5_8f99vjVecE0iLKDNQxCuKg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231781-Beef-Sukiyaki-ddmfs-step-5-084-4bd092ed7df247c18cda2d3c30064c1c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231781/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add dashi mixture, noodles, beef, tofu, and green onions; bring to a simmer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
